{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01087","headline":"相和歌辞 王昭君 · 顾朝阳","name":"相和歌辞 王昭君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫将铅粉匣，不用镜花光。\n一去边城路，何情更画妆。\n影销胡地月，衣尽汉宫香。\n妾死非关命，祗缘怨断肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾朝阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01087.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01087","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}